    "sub_name": "日文(一)",
    "sub_ename": "JAPANESE(1)",
    "describe_ch": "從日語的五十音教起，配合選定教材，讓同學逐步地認識日語之語音、句型及簡單文法，從而活用於日常會話之中。",
    "describe_eh": "Starting with the 50 phonetic symbols, students will  learn the basic speech sounds, patterns and grammar of Japanese from the textbooks chosen by the instructors and apply what they have learned to their daily life conversation.",
